# Evals: {{name}}

Cases and fixtures for `skills/{{name}}`. How evals work, how to run them,
and how to write graders: [../README.md](../README.md).

```bash
claude plugin eval . --eval-dir tests/evals/{{name}} --scaffold --allow-tools Bash Write Edit
```

Add at least one case to each folder before marking the skill `ready`;
`npm run validate` checks this.

